WEBVTT

00:05:55.142 --> 00:06:00.147
I felt like no matter
how many things I try,

00:06:00.189 --> 00:06:02.817
no one would ever
really see me as a woman.

00:06:02.817 --> 00:06:05.861
In science, your credibility
is everything,

00:06:05.903 --> 00:06:09.156
and people were
snickering in the hallways,

00:06:10.032 --> 00:06:11.492
giving me stares,

00:06:11.492 --> 00:06:13.327
looks of disgust --

00:06:13.369 --> 00:06:14.995
afraid to be near me.

00:06:16.247 --> 00:06:19.166
I remember my first big talk
after transition.

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:20.418
It was in Italy.

00:06:20.459 --> 00:06:22.878
I'd given prestigious talks before,

00:06:22.878 --> 00:06:25.714
but this one, I was terrified.

00:06:25.714 --> 00:06:27.508
I looked out into the audience,

00:06:27.508 --> 00:06:30.386
and the whispers started --